means that we can.

00:07:17.600 --> 00:07:18.650
So that's one aspect.

00:07:18.650 --> 00:07:20.770
The data scientist that
I'm hiring for right

00:07:20.770 --> 00:07:24.880
now is going to be focused a lot
on driving some more engagement

00:07:24.880 --> 00:07:27.470
and solving our
lifetime value problems.

00:07:27.470 --> 00:07:30.190
So I think some
companies-- like,

00:07:30.190 --> 00:07:32.740
especially if you consider
back to Domino's, where

00:07:32.740 --> 00:07:34.900
if you want to drive
an increase in lifetime

00:07:34.900 --> 00:07:37.810
