when they were once a month?

00:07:41.230 --> 00:07:44.800
Or how do you get them to
increase more of their pizzas

00:07:44.800 --> 00:07:46.450
within the orders
that they're making?

00:07:46.450 --> 00:07:50.110
But within the Knot,
in our global brands

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:51.968
there is a pretty
discrete amount of time

00:07:51.968 --> 00:07:54.010
that somebody is actually
considered our customer

00:07:54.010 --> 00:07:57.325
because they join our--
they come to our platform,

00:07:57.325 --> 00:07:59.200
