no longer really,

00:08:05.860 --> 00:08:08.393
like, revenue relevant
for us anymore unless they

00:08:08.393 --> 00:08:10.060
get-- they're doing
something like thank

00:08:10.060 --> 00:08:11.270
you notes after the fact.

00:08:11.270 --> 00:08:13.870
So we have a pretty discrete
amount of time for somebody

00:08:13.870 --> 00:08:14.860
to get engaged.

00:08:14.860 --> 00:08:17.950
So, how do we identify the value
that we can get out of a couple

00:08:17.950 --> 00:08:20.662
as soon as we acquire them and
getting them to engage along

00:08:20.662 --> 00:08:21.620
the appropriate manner?

00:08:21.620 --> 00:08:23.710
So it's going to be pretty
cross-functional working with--

00:08:23.710 --> 00:08:26.500
not just within marketing to
try to drive, like, acquisition

00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:29.320
