with in order to just

00:09:55.753 --> 00:09:57.510
have your wedding go smoothly.

00:09:57.510 --> 00:09:59.300
So we are a dual
sided marketplace

00:09:59.300 --> 00:10:01.520
where couples can come into
our platform and search

00:10:01.520 --> 00:10:03.437
for vendors that are
local to their area based

00:10:03.437 --> 00:10:06.230
