what they're looking for.

00:10:06.230 --> 00:10:08.000
But then also, we're
working closely

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:11.570
with the vendors themselves
to have that aspect about,

00:10:11.570 --> 00:10:14.510
here's how you can market
within our platform

00:10:14.510 --> 00:10:18.200
and consider getting just in
the eyes of the couples who

00:10:18.200 --> 00:10:19.890
are looking for you.

00:10:19.890 --> 00:10:22.130
And so that aspect of being
a dual sided marketplace

00:10:22.130 --> 00:10:24.710
from a data perspective allows
for a lot of fun challenges,

00:10:24.710 --> 00:10:26.280
because we're not
just a B2C company.

00:10:26.280 --> 00:10:27.500
We're also a B2B company.

00:10:27.500 --> 00:10:29.570
So we have a lot of
different challenges

00:10:29.570 --> 00:10:33.657
to try to approach
that from both angles.

00:10:33.657 --> 00:10:34.740
It's really interesting.

