and marketing perspective?

00:12:04.627 --> 00:12:05.960
Yeah, that's a great question.

00:12:05.960 --> 00:12:07.690
So, I wasn't here at the time.

00:12:07.690 --> 00:12:09.412
So I'm speaking somewhat
second hand only

00:12:09.412 --> 00:12:10.870
