heard through this.

00:12:10.870 --> 00:12:14.020
And a lot-- and it definitely
changed our seasonal patterns

00:12:14.020 --> 00:12:16.120
in terms of when
people were coming in,

00:12:16.120 --> 00:12:17.620
especially early
on in the pandemic,

00:12:17.620 --> 00:12:20.312
when people weren't necessarily
actively planning out

00:12:20.312 --> 00:12:22.270
weddings because they
didn't know if they would

00:12:22.270 --> 00:12:25.360
be able to have a hosted
wedding with all their loved

00:12:25.360 --> 00:12:27.895
ones actually live
in a room somewhere.

00:12:27.895 --> 00:12:29.770
So that made it a bit
of a challenge in terms

00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:31.120
of couples coming into it.

00:12:31.120 --> 00:12:33.347
But we did see a lot
of pushed out planning.

00:12:33.347 --> 00:12:34.930
Kind of to your
point, like, if you're

00:12:34.930 --> 00:12:37.780
getting delayed or
postponed, then you

00:12:37.780 --> 00:12:40.030
may need to have a longer
cycle that you're actually

00:12:40.030 --> 00:12:41.410
considering.

00:12:41.410 --> 00:12:45.880
One of the benefits is
that weddings-- and this

00:12:45.880 --> 00:12:48.640
is generally called, like,
the industry of love.

00:12:48.640 --> 00:12:51.280
Like, we're all about
celebrating these big moments

00:12:51.280 --> 00:12:52.330
in your life.

00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:55.042
It's fairly recession-proof,
which is a pretty good thing,

00:12:55.042 --> 00:12:57.250
where there's always people
that are getting married.

00:12:57.250 --> 00:13:00.010
And even if it's smaller,
where they may not necessarily

00:13:00.010 --> 00:13:02.350
be spending as much, whether
that is due to a session

00:13:02.350 --> 00:13:04.630
or due to the
pandemic, we do still

00:13:04.630 --> 00:13:06.880
see a significant amount of
couples using our platform

00:13:06.880 --> 00:13:09.190
to help plan out the
best event for them.

00:13:12.240 --> 00:13:13.950
Marlene, I see your
hand is raised too

00:13:13.950 --> 00:13:16.560
if you want to jump in.

00:13:16.560 --> 00:13:17.080
Sure, hi.

