00:14:04.020 --> 00:14:04.770
I don't know.

00:14:04.770 --> 00:14:06.810
Those were just thoughts that--

00:14:06.810 --> 00:14:10.467
how to expand your
client longevity, right?

00:14:10.467 --> 00:14:11.800
Yeah, that's a great question.

00:14:11.800 --> 00:14:15.780
So I think generally, when
I'm thinking about it,

00:14:15.780 --> 00:14:18.920
and it's just how the company
is, like, our biggest market is

00:14:18.920 --> 00:14:19.920
