00:46:53.150 --> 00:46:53.650
Exactly.

00:46:56.580 --> 00:46:58.230
Let me just double check here.

00:46:58.230 --> 00:47:01.890
I haven't given any of
the anonymous questions.

00:47:01.890 --> 00:47:04.980
But I think, Katherine, you had
another question in the chat

00:47:04.980 --> 00:47:07.092
too if you want to jump in.

00:47:07.092 --> 00:47:10.340
KATHERINE GERTON: Yeah, and
it may be a little charged

00:47:10.340 --> 00:47:11.370
for this format.

00:47:11.370 --> 00:47:15.800
So, feel free to cage
however you'd like.

