But just curious with how
many aspects of weddings

00:47:19.700 --> 00:47:23.930
are now legally and
politically socially complex,

00:47:23.930 --> 00:47:29.000
what sort of are your guys'
marketing and engagement teams

00:47:29.000 --> 00:47:32.330
doing maybe in political
action or other sorts

00:47:32.330 --> 00:47:35.750
of social community activities
using some of the data

00:47:35.750 --> 00:47:37.255
that you collect?

00:47:37.255 --> 00:47:38.880
Yeah, that's a
