00:48:16.610 --> 00:48:18.530
then I can filter
on that one just

00:48:18.530 --> 00:48:22.083
to kind of keep like for like
and look for those focus areas.

00:48:22.083 --> 00:48:23.750
But we're not necessarily
doing anything

00:48:23.750 --> 00:48:26.450
in terms of an analysis or
data science perspective

00:48:26.450 --> 00:48:28.120
to share anything out there.

00:48:28.120 --> 00:48:30.620
I think it could be a pretty
