00:48:30.620 --> 00:48:33.110
journalism within some
of our editorial content

00:48:33.110 --> 00:48:34.820
to look at the different trends
that are happening there,

00:48:34.820 --> 00:48:35.320
though.

00:48:37.720 --> 00:48:40.690
KATHERINE GERTON:
Yeah, I actually

